	)
	(text "1S protected LiPo (JST PH). CHECK PACK POLARITY: vendors disagree on which pin is +.\nF101 + Q101: a short trips the fuse; a reversed pack leaves Q101 off (its body diode blocks).\nQ101 is fully on either way current flows, so the XIAO still charges the cell through it.\nSW101 is the main switch: off disconnects everything, including charging through the XIAO.\nU101 makes the partners' +3.3V analog rail straight from the cell (holds 3.3 V down to ~3.35 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 48.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a525a762-254d-40e7-a2c5-b049b59bfa61")
	)
