	(text "R101 / R102 pick the analog LDO's input (fit exactly one).\nDefault, R101 fitted: the switched cell (VBAT).\nMove the 0 ohm to R102: USB 5 V from the XIAO, so the\nanalog side runs with no cell. BENCH TESTING ONLY:\nthe electrodes then share the PC's ground via USB."
